  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7cdad5e2c57f2406998004c57dea196c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 7594093583523840
    m_Localized: You can move around with the [Movement] keys and interact with [Interact],
      though I'm sure you already figured that out. When speaking with someone, make
      sure you stay close enough to hear them. It's rude to walk away you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7594243680886784
    m_Localized: Ms. Lynx
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7603819314667520
    m_Localized: You can use [UseSpoon] to use your current soup. Try destroying
      those bushes up ahead with your starting soup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7604375001227264
    m_Localized: Sometimes, destroying objects will give you ingredients to cook
      with. Try picking them up with [Interact].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7604545055088640
    m_Localized: You finally woke up! You seem to have lost your memory, I will try
      to help you remember your soup training.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7606674075410432
    m_Localized: 'This here chest contains a soup base, you''re key for making any
      soup. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7606856452136960
    m_Localized: 'However, you''re missing just two things: an Ability ingredient
      and a Campfire. First let''s find an Ability ingredient.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7607430199369728
    m_Localized: Ingredients from foraging, however, are known as Flavor Ingredients.
      These enhance a soup's properties in interesting ways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7607670486851584
    m_Localized: There is a monster in the room ahead. Slay it and let's make it
      into soup!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7608351474049024
    m_Localized: Bonus tip, use [Dash] to perform a quick dash and avoid any attacks
      they may throw at you. Be careful little chef.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7758371196231680
    m_Localized: The monster that lies here is what we call a Taterhop. Now, we just
      need a Campfire to cook it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7758567355441152
    m_Localized: To start, interact with the campfire and select the soup base you
      want to use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7759696256557056
    m_Localized: 'Then, select the ingredients from your basket you wish to use. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8005049320988672
    m_Localized: 'Swap between soups with [CycleSpoonLeft] and [CycleSpoonRight],
      or [Bowl1], [Bowl2], [Bowl3], [Bowl4]. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8774983756013568
    m_Localized: Soup bases can be reused after they run out, so no need to be shy
      with the soup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14859053955014656
    m_Localized: 'Give it a go and come back after you''re done. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63450185169457152
    m_Localized: In the bottom left, you can see your soups. Before your accident,
      you were a fantastic chef, able to make soup that granted special powers. 
      Currently, you only have the one default soup, which has a short jab attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63454423106801664
    m_Localized: 'Now that''s some fine cooking little fella. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194882756609011712
    m_Localized: Soups require an Ability ingredient to give them their power, which
      are dropped by slaying monsters found down here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194884331108790272
    m_Localized: 'Campfires guide your path in these confusing labyrinths and help
      you make delicious soups. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194886840174997504
    m_Localized: Remember, every soup needs at least one Ability ingredient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194897269815209984
    m_Localized: Now venture deeper into the dungeon and find the exit. We are all
      counting on you Soupmaster!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 194898355351416832
    m_Localized: One more thing... Hit me with some soup on the way out. I didn't
      have lunch today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
